      "caption": "Readers take no lock: rcu_read_lock is nearly free and rcu_dereference loads the pointer.",
      "narration": "Readers take no lock and never block. rcu_read_lock merely marks a critical section, and rcu_dereference loads the shared pointer safely.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "RCU readers",
